  "description": "Experience the ultimate in off-road performance with our Carbon Fiber Full Suspension Electric Mountain Bike. Crafted with a stiff carbon fiber frame and powered by the formidable Bafang Ultra motor, this bike is designed to conquer any trail with ease.\nFeatures:\n\nPowerful Motor: 1000W Bafang Ultra Mid-drive Motor for extreme off-road performance.\n\nHigh Torque: 160Nm of torque for tackling even the most extreme hills.\n\nGenerous Load Capacity: Supports up to 265lbs, allowing you to bring all your gear.\n\nOn-Demand Throttle: Pedal optional with the convenient on-demand throttle feature.\n\nSmooth Pedal Assistance: Torque and cadence sensors provide smooth and powerful pedal assist.\n\nLong-lasting Battery: Includes a 48V 17.5Ah 840Wh battery and charger for extended riding adventures.\n\nBenefits:\n\nConquer any trail with ease and confidence.\nTackle extreme hills with power and precision.\nBring along all your gear without sacrificing performance.\nEnjoy the option to pedal or use the throttle for effortless cruising.\nExperience smooth and powerful pedal assistance for a comfortable riding experience.\nRide for miles without worrying about running out of power.\n\nElevate your off-road adventures with the Carbon Fiber Full Suspension Electric Mountain Bike. Conquer new trails, push your limits, and make every ride an exhilarating adventure.",
